# .graphifyignore
#
# Scopes the graphify knowledge graph to the codebase and the top-level project
# docs (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, etc.) only. The .planning/ GSD artifacts are NOT
# indexed here: gsd-graph (.gsd-graph/, see CLAUDE.md) owns them. Uses gitignore
# syntax and is merged after .gitignore, with these patterns winning on conflict
# (last-match-wins).

# GSD planning artifacts are EXCLUDED from graphify since 2026-11-22 (quick
# 261122-93a; they were indexed from 2026-08-22). gsd-graph indexes a curated
# planning corpus instead.
.planning/

# gsd-graph's planning-graph store, not code. .gitignore keeps most of it out
# but un-ignores config.json, and this line keeps graphify off it too.
.gsd-graph/

# throwaway working files
scratchpad/

# graphify's own output, must not index itself
graphify-out/

# agent config, not project code
.claude/
